 in Rogue one  a Star Wars story as the fighting monk  charit imway due to his achievements in  recent years in 27 17 he was even  admitted to the academy of Motion  Picture Arts and Sciences the  organization that annually Awards the  Oscars the final well-known actress we  have is Natalia Tena in the role of  Katya most of you will know tenna for  playing The Ore nymphadora Tonks from  Harry Potter her last major television  role was in the Mandalorian in 2019. we  still have one big name for you but a  role name in the film is not yet known  Clancy Brown will also be involved in  the film the 1.92 meter tall giant  became known in the role of kurgan in  Highlander from 1986. since then he has  participated in well over 200  Productions as an actor or voice actor  his last role was in the rather unknown  movie Last looks in 2021  as always as long as the filmmakers  remain silent it is not that easy to  talk about the plot at least Keanu  Reeves himself presented the first  teaser trailer for the movie at the  Comic-Con in San Diego besides a lot of  action the trailer shows Jon training  hard for his Vendetta with a Bowery King  at the end the king of the homeless even  shows up with a fresh suit and asks John  whether he's ready anyhow it's clear  that the two will be hunting down the  high table in its 12 bosses from the  looks of the trailer these will include  Clancy Brown and scarsgard's character  another interesting aspect will be the  roles of Winston and Sharon both have  obviously turned against Jon but whether  they really still work for the high  table is unclear after all the latter  would have sacrificed the continental  and Winston without batting an eye it  will also be particularly exciting to  delve deeper into the character of the  Bowery King and his Empire or rather  what is left of it for one thing should  be clear he and John can only move in  the shadows now in the trailer Akira  tracker and shimazu seem to be on Jon's  side mainly because